	<string>The microphone is used only when you start a live call with Janna or Bassem, the platform's assistants, so they can hear you.</string>
	<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
	<string>The camera is used only when you choose to take a photo or video to upload (registration documents, product photos) or turn on your camera in a live call.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Your photo library is used only when you choose a photo or document to upload, such as registration documents or product photos.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryAddUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Lets you save an image from the platform to your photos when you choose to.</string>
	<key>CFBundleLocalizations</key>
	<array>
		<string>ar</string>
		<string>en</string>
	</array>
